ebm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268900/extras/cb655dafb2dad069151ce7d6703d3574.mp4?t=1745614814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>ment to adapt to the dangers of the universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Threats</strong>: In the aftermath of the <strong>Great AI Cataclysm</strong>, hostile AI entities control the void. Battle against corrupted machines and alien AI as you uncover the remnants of a lost civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong>: Venture into forgotten sectors, uncover hidden lore, and piece together the mystery of humanity\u2019s collapse. Your journey will be filled with unexpected encounters and choices that shape your experience.</p></li></ul>",
